OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fbecoming patchier through the evening
OL,8,Fand overnight. Isolated clearer spells
OL,9,Fdevelop later. The easterly wind eases
OL,10,Fin most places but remains breezy over
OL,11,Fthe hills and coast. Temperatures near
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA grey start to the day with
OL,15,Fpatchy rain possible. Turning drier
OL,16,Fthrough the day but remaining largely
OL,17,Fcloudy. Lighter winds than previous
OL,18,Fdays but feeling cool under any cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
